SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells while retaining Ebb & Flow.",
SpellDescription,"Dispel debuffs and spin for 10 to 12 turns: debuff immunity, 80% magical DR, and 1d4 to 2d4+2 base magical damage per turn (85-205 DPS mapped via K_dmg=15, scaled by DEX & Bladeform attack speed) to adjacent 3x3 foes; can crit with Blade Dance.",
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",
SpellDescription,"Launch a surge of water dealing base damage, knocking back, and stunning the target. Bonus damage scales with Agility-to-Strength ratio while stun duration scales with Strength-to-Agility ratio.",
SpellDescription,"Leap to a targeted enemy and unleash 5 to 12 rapid invulnerable weapon slashes (weapon + stat + 2 to 3 bonus damage per slash) across nearby foes, triggering Blade Dance crits and Bladeform bonuses.",
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,
SpellDescription,"Shift Agility into Strength and Constitution (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats while raising both maximum and current HP.",
SpellDescription,"Shift Strength and Constitution into Agility (1 to 5 points by mastery), conserving total stats and lowering maximum HP without draining current HP.",
SpellDescription,"Summon a fragile movable Healing Ward (1 HP, max 1 active) for 36 to 48 turns that heals all allies within 2 tiles for 1% to 3.25% of their maximum HP each turn.",
